== mary_intro ==
Mary: What do you want?
Liora: Eek- she's super grumpy. Wait, I can see the similarity now...
Mary: Are you from that crummy town? Ugh, tell my old man to keep the money coming. I won't have enough for tonight.
    + [Ask what's tonight]
        -> whats_tonight
    + [Ask if she is alright]
        -> are_you_alright

== whats_tonight ==
Mary: The party of course! I need to get all the booze I can.
Liora: ... So you're using the money on alcohol?
Mary: What else would I use it for?
Liora: ... I didn't think Mr. Michael's daughter would be like this...
-> END

== are_you_alright ==
Mary: Just shut up kid, the migrane is getting worse.
Liora: ...
-> END